  "description": "A dynaset over \"SELECT ID, N AS N1, N AS N2 FROM T WHERE ID = 3\" with held Fields N1 and N2, inside BeginTrans (rolled back at the end): Edit, assign N1 31, read N1 and N2, Update, read N1 and N2; Edit, assign N2 32 then N1 33, read both, Update, read both, Errors; Requery and read both; a snapshot over T row 3 reads N. Asks which source column a duplicate alias writes, whether the sibling alias follows before and after Update, and the stored value. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
